# Rendered plaques. Outputs of scripts/generate-*.js, not sources: each SVG is a
# 240KB-635KB single unioned path (text already converted), so they are large,
# binary-ish and re-render exactly from the scripts + scripts/fonts/. The older
# berlin-style/brass-style set was tracked and it only ever produced noisy diffs.
public/plaques/lightburn/
public/plaques/premium/
plaque-scratch/

# claude-flow / ruvector local agent state (regenerated per session)
.claude-flow/
**/.claude-flow/
ruvector.db
**/ruvector.db

# local design captures & page screenshots (large binaries, not sources)
design-screenshots/
screencapture-*.pdf
